VEYE Viewer Camera Model Display Fix
Date: 2026-10-21

Issue:
When multiple cameras were connected, the main window always displayed the same
camera model on the left, although each camera's camera_model value in sysfs was
correct.

Cause:
The sysfs path was overwritten by the last camera found during scanning. The
path was also not updated when a different camera was selected.

Fix:
Use the first camera in the scan results as the initial camera. When the
selection changes, update the sysfs path using that camera's I2C bus and read
its camera_model value.

Verification:
cmake --build build -j2: passed
git diff --check: passed
Note: Runtime verification with multiple connected cameras has not been performed.
